##### Decision Variables

$x_i \in \mathbb{Z}_{\geq 0}$: Number of vehicles of type $i$ to order per day, for each $i \in I$ (where $I$ is the set of all vehicle types listed below).

##### Parameters

Let $I$ be the set of vehicle types:
- Sedan
- SUV
- Truck
- Convertible
- Minivan
- Coupe
