- Electric SUV

For each $i \in I$:
- $v_i$: Profit per unit of vehicle type $i$
- $w_i$: Inventory weight per unit of vehicle type $i$

Parameter values (from products.csv):

| Vehicle Type        | $v_i$ (Profit) | $w_i$ (Weight) |
